Tests for the PASM lexer and parser.


*** Decimal integer literals ***

  $ assembler ../examples/lexer_parser/decimal.pasm --format ascii -o decimal-ascii
  Wrote: decimal-ascii
  $ cat decimal-ascii
  00000000000000010000100000101010
  00000000000000010001011111010110
  00000000000100000001100001100100
  00000000000100000010000010011100


